@startuml
title AI4RIG — Deployment: Host / Client Mode
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5058
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F6F3EE
skinparam noteBorderColor #9A6B2F
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam nodeBorderColor #2C3138
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FDFDFD
skinparam componentBorderColor #4A5058
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F6F3EE
skinparam databaseBorderColor #9A6B2F

node "RIG Office LAN — no internet required" {

  node "Host Machine\n(one designated PC)" as HOST {
    component "Electron App\n(host mode)" as EH
    component "API + Bucket Engine" as API
    database "SQLite\ncase database" as DB
  }

  node "Advisor Workstation 1" as W1 {
    component "Electron App\n(client mode)" as E1
  }

  node "Advisor Workstation N" as W2 {
    component "Electron App\n(client mode)" as E2
  }
}

EH --> API
API --> DB
E1 --> API : HTTP over LAN
E2 --> API : HTTP over LAN

note bottom of HOST
  One executable, two roles. On first run the user
  chooses "Host this database" or "Connect to a host."
  No cloud account, no server, no IT staff required.
  (Story: Shared Employee Access)
end note
@enduml
